{
 "de4655ed-c0f7-43fe-934e-4a1ff91a1a4c": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$A=\\tan^{-1}2$, $B=\\tan^{-1}3$; $A+B=\\tan^{-1}2+\\tan^{-1}3$। $xy=6>1$ বলে\n$A+B=\\pi+\\tan^{-1}\\frac{2+3}{1-6}=\\pi+\\tan^{-1}(-1)=\\pi-\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\frac{3\\pi}{4}$।\nত্রিভুজে $A+B+C=\\pi$ ⇒ $C=\\pi-\\frac{3\\pi}{4}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: ত্রিভুজের তিন কোণের যোগফল $\\pi$; tan যোগফল সূত্রে $xy>1$-এ $\\pi$ যোগ।\n"
 },
 "fac25694-cbc8-4791-a389-135b9701c740": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "1",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\sin^{-1}x+\\sin^{-1}y=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ ⇒ $\\sin^{-1}y=\\cos^{-1}x$ ⇒ $y=\\sqrt{1-x^{2}}$ ⇒ $x^{2}+y^{2}=1$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: পূরক কোণ identity; $x^{2}+y^{2}=1$।\n"
 },
 "d437d1ae-5add-4ccb-9ccd-f98ebf1e7430": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "$tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{2}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\alpha=\\sin^{-1}\\frac{4}{5}$ ⇒ $\\sin\\alpha=\\frac{4}{5}$, $\\cos\\alpha=\\frac{3}{5}$।\n$\\tan\\frac{\\alpha}{2}=\\frac{\\sin\\alpha}{1+\\cos\\alpha}=\\frac{4/5}{1+3/5}=\\frac{4/5}{8/5}=\\frac{1}{2}$\n⇒ $\\frac{\\alpha}{2}=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{2}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: অর্ধকোণ সূত্র $\\tan\\frac{\\alpha}{2}=\\frac{\\sin\\alpha}{1+\\cos\\alpha}$।\n"
 },
 "6455c263-1d42-44e0-a719-35b5c49cf298": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\cos^{-1}x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\sin^{-1}x$ বসিয়ে:\n$2\\sin^{-1}x-\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\sin^{-1}x\\right)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ ⇒ $3\\sin^{-1}x=\\pi$ ⇒ $\\sin^{-1}x=\\frac{\\pi}{3}$ ⇒ $x=\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{3}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: পূরক সম্পর্কে রূপান্তর; $\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{3}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$।\n"
 },
 "80a12841-ac72-4356-b91b-6fc5285510a7": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 3,
  "answer_text": "4",
  "explanation_text": "\nউপবৃত্ত $\\frac{x^{2}}{9}+\\frac{y^{2}}{4}=1$-এ $a^{2}=9$ ⇒ $a=3$; $b^{2}=4$ ⇒ $b=2$।\nক্ষুদ্র অক্ষের দৈর্ঘ্য $=2b=4$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: উপবৃত্তের ক্ষুদ্র অক্ষ $2b$; এখানে $b=2$, তাই দৈর্ঘ্য ৪।\n"
 },
 "a238d200-cf72-4ce1-afc3-774869c86fbf": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{\\pi}{8}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$2\\left(\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{2}\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{7}\\right)=2\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}+\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{7}$\n$=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{2/3}{1-1/9}\\right)+\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{7}=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{3}{4}+\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{7}$\n$=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{\\frac{3}{4}+\\frac{1}{7}}{1-\\frac{3}{28}}\\right)=\\tan^{-1}1=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$।\n∴ নির্ণেয় রাশি $=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\frac{\\pi}{8}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: দ্বিগুণ করে সহজ রূপ; $2\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{3}{4}$, যোগফল $\\frac{\\pi}{4}$ — অর্ধেক $\\frac{\\pi}{8}$।\n"
 },
 "912ad470-99e5-4d3c-a06b-2a4fe0d7ae91": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\cot^{-1}3=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}$; ∴ কোণদ্বয়ের যোগফল $=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{2}+\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}}{1-\\frac{1}{6}}\\right)=\\tan^{-1}1=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$।\n∴ $\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\cot^{-1}x=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{x}$; $\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$।\n"
 },
 "5df2cfb9-ccf2-41f5-b5a6-da664e7ca68d": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{2}+\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}}{1-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{3}}\\right)=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{5/6}{5/6}\\right)=\\tan^{-1}1=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: গুণফল $\\frac{1}{6}<1$ বলে সরাসরি যোগফল সূত্র।\n"
 },
 "7e0556b1-1b42-408a-ba08-15145c7c1877": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{\\pi}{6}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\sqrt{3}\\cos A+\\sin A=2\\cos\\left(A-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)=2$ ⇒ $\\cos\\left(A-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)=1$\n⇒ $A-\\frac{\\pi}{6}=0$ ($0<A<\\pi$-তে) ⇒ $A=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $R=2$, $\\alpha=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$ রূপান্তর; $\\cos x=1\\Rightarrow x=0$।\n"
 },
 "f3cb962f-9ebf-4eec-b62c-11ea08d1c677": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 3,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\sqrt{3}\\sin y-\\cos y=2\\sin\\left(y-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)=2$ ⇒ $\\sin\\left(y-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)=1$\n⇒ $y-\\frac{\\pi}{6}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ ($0<y<2\\pi$-তে) ⇒ $y=\\frac{2\\pi}{3}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $R=2$, $\\alpha=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$; দ্বিতীয় চতুর্ভাগে একমাত্র মান $\\frac{2\\pi}{3}$।\n"
 },
 "f3c31d71-ff99-4680-8b45-dd14181a0e1a": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{4 \\pi}{3}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$5\\tan^{2}\\theta-\\sec^{2}\\theta=11$; $\\sec^{2}\\theta=1+\\tan^{2}\\theta$:\n$5\\tan^{2}\\theta-(1+\\tan^{2}\\theta)=11$ ⇒ $4\\tan^{2}\\theta=12$ ⇒ $\\tan^{2}\\theta=3$ ⇒ $\\tan\\theta=\\pm\\sqrt{3}$।\n$\\pi<\\theta<2\\pi$-তে: $\\tan\\theta=\\sqrt{3}$ → $\\theta=\\frac{4\\pi}{3}$ (তৃতীয় চতুর্ভাগ)।\n∴ $\\theta=\\frac{4\\pi}{3}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $(0,\\pi)$-তে $\\frac{\\pi}{3}$ ছিল; $(\\pi,2\\pi)$-তে $\\pi$ বাড়িয়ে $\\frac{4\\pi}{3}$।\n"
 },
 "1f6bd132-b0c0-41c7-a013-5bae995ffc60": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "$\\cos x=-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\operatorname{cosec}x=2$ ⇒ $\\sin x=\\frac{1}{2}$; $\\cot x=-\\sqrt{3}$ ⇒ $\\cot x=\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}$ ⇒ $\\cos x=\\cot x\\cdot\\sin x=-\\sqrt{3}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}=-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\cos x=\\cot x\\sin x$; আপাতত OPT_2 সঠিক।\n"
 },
 "9d75ca02-49f0-4c8e-87ef-adf9844e7f61": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{a+b}{1-a b}$",
  "explanation_text": "\nLHS: $\\tan^{-1}\\frac{2x}{1-x^{2}}=2\\tan^{-1}x$; RHS: $\\sin^{-1}\\frac{2a}{1+a^{2}}=2\\tan^{-1}a$, $\\cos^{-1}\\frac{1-b^{2}}{1+b^{2}}=2\\tan^{-1}b$।\n∴ $2\\tan^{-1}x=2\\tan^{-1}a+2\\tan^{-1}b$ ⇒ $\\tan^{-1}x=\\tan^{-1}a+\\tan^{-1}b$ ⇒ $x=\\frac{a+b}{1-ab}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\tan(2\\theta)=\\frac{2t}{1-t^{2}}$ ও $\\cos\\tan(2\\theta)=\\frac{1-t^{2}}{1+t^{2}}$-র পরিচয়; যোগফল সূত্র।\n"
 },
 "7dfd2f4c-e3b2-40f5-a523-5c45cd4ce841": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "15",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\sec^{2}(\\tan^{-1}2)=1+\\tan^{2}(\\tan^{-1}2)=1+4=5$।\n$\\operatorname{cosec}^{2}(\\cot^{-1}3)=1+\\cot^{2}(\\cot^{-1}3)=1+9=10$।\nযোগফল $=5+10=15$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\sec^{2}A=1+\\tan^{2}A$, $\\operatorname{cosec}^{2}A=1+\\cot^{2}A$।\n"
 },
 "cb35a142-ec65-4475-9865-926f374c75ec": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "0",
  "explanation_text": "\nজানা পরিচয়: $\\frac{1}{2}\\cos^{-1}\\left(\\frac{1-x}{1+x}\\right)=\\tan^{-1}\\sqrt{x}$ (x≥0)।\n∴ $\\tan^{-1}\\sqrt{x}-\\frac{1}{2}\\cos^{-1}\\frac{1-x}{1+x}=\\tan^{-1}\\sqrt{x}-\\tan^{-1}\\sqrt{x}=0$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\frac{1-x}{1+x}=\\cos\\left(2\\tan^{-1}\\sqrt{x}\\right)$; দুই রাশি সমান হওয়ায় পার্থক্য ০।\n"
 },
 "388647ba-6aa3-446d-afd6-75e32896510d": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 3,
  "answer_text": "$n\\pi \\pm \\frac{\\pi}{6}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\tan2\\theta\\tan\\theta=1$ ⇒ $\\tan2\\theta=\\cot\\theta=\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\theta\\right)$\n⇒ $2\\theta=n\\pi+\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\theta$ ⇒ $\\theta=\\frac{(2n+1)\\pi}{6}$ ⇒ সিংগুলারিটি বাদে $\\theta=n\\pi\\pm\\frac{\\pi}{6}$, $n\\in\\mathbb{Z}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: ২৪১-এর পুনরাবৃত্তি; $n\\pi\\pm\\frac{\\pi}{6}$।\n"
 },
 "72d7f947-5e36-409a-a28b-f7fc200f1bb7": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{2}+\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{5/6}{1-1/6}\\right)=\\tan^{-1}1=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: ২৮৪-এর পুনরাবৃত্তি।\n"
 },
 "eb4f9336-16f9-4609-8779-5aed23704834": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\cot^{-1}3=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}$; যোগফল $=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{2}+\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$; $\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: ২৮৩-এর পুনরাবৃত্তি।\n"
 },
 "f434608e-6080-4a22-b957-f226d07d1fbe": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "$\\theta=\\frac{1}{2} \\cos ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{34}}\\right)$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\cot\\theta-\\tan\\theta=\\frac{\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}-\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}=\\frac{\\cos^{2}\\theta-\\sin^{2}\\theta}{\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}=\\frac{2\\cos2\\theta}{\\sin2\\theta}=2\\cot2\\theta=\\frac{6}{5}$\n⇒ $\\cot2\\theta=\\frac{3}{5}$ ⇒ $2\\theta=\\cot^{-1}\\frac{3}{5}=\\cos^{-1}\\left(\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{34}}\\right)$ (যেহেতু $\\sin=\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{34}}$, অতিভুজ $\\sqrt{34}$)।\n∴ $\\theta=\\frac{1}{2}\\cos^{-1}\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{34}}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\cot\\theta-\\tan\\theta=2\\cot2\\theta$ পরিচয়; $\\cos^{-1}$-এ পরিণত করা।\n"
 }
}